{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07450","headline":"奉酬辛大夫喜湖南腊月连日降雪见示之作 · 刘长卿","name":"奉酬辛大夫喜湖南腊月连日降雪见示之作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"长沙耆旧拜旌麾，喜见江潭积雪时。\n柳絮三冬先北地，梅花一夜徧南枝。\n初开窗阁寒光满，欲掩军城暮色迟。\n闾里何人不相庆，万家同唱郢中词。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07450.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07450","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}